					"nextDialogs": [
						740820721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820721,
					"content": "哎呀！什麼意思？這滴水珠是美露莘？我有點暈了，到底是什麼啦，妳不才是美露莘嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820722,
					"content": "珀西芙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820723,
					"content": "呃…妳是珀西芙？還是妳叫珀西芙？等等…我一定會被妳的答案弄得更暈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820724,
					"content": "我決定就叫妳珀西芙了，好不好？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820725,
					"content": "美露莘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820726,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}…怎麼辦？我完全搞不懂她的意思，她到底在說什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820727,
					"content": "妳能聽懂我們的話，對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820728
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820728,
					"content": "珀西芙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820729,
					"content": "這滴水珠是鑰匙，對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820730
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820730,
					"content": "珀西芙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820731,
					"content": "妳不是人，對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820732
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820732,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820733,
					"content": "呃…突然罵人不太好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820734,
					"content": "我不是人，對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820735
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820735,
					"content": "美…美露莘？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820736,
					"content": "啊！等等，我好像有點聽出來了…「珀西芙」的意思是肯定，「美露莘」的意思是否定，難道是這個意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820737,
					"content": "珀西芙！珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820738,
					"content": "原來妳不是叫珀西芙…對不起，我搞錯了妳的名字。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820739,
					"content": "珀西芙…喜歡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820740
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820740,
					"content": "妳喜歡這個名字？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820741
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820741,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820742
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820742,
					"content": "#太好了！那就這樣叫妳了，嘿嘿！我是派蒙，這是{NICKNAME}，很高興認識妳，珀西芙，我還沒見過像妳這樣的美露莘呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820743
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820743,
					"content": "#派蒙，珀西芙！{NICKNAME}，珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820744
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820744,
					"content": "伊黎耶…美露莘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820745
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820745,
					"content": "…伊黎耶否定？呃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820746
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820746,
					"content": "伊黎耶島不好了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820747
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820747,
					"content": "伊黎耶，美露莘，現在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820748
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820748,
					"content": "珀西芙，伊黎耶，保護…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820749
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820749,
					"content": "伊黎耶島正在變得不好，然後，妳要保護它？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820750
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820750,
					"content": "#派蒙，{NICKNAME}，伊黎耶，邦邦，邦邦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820751
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820751,
					"content": "#呃…這次有五個詞，呃…妳希望派蒙和{NICKNAME}對伊黎耶島邦邦邦邦這樣嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820752
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820752,
					"content": "美露莘！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820753
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820753,
					"content": "妳希望我們幫忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820754
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820754,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820755
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820755,
					"content": "原來是幫忙呀！幸好幸好，如果要讓我們對這座島邦邦邦邦，那就真的滿難的了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820756
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820756,
					"content": "邦邦，邦邦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820757,
						740820761
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820757,
					"content": "有報酬嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820758
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820758,
					"content": "報…酬？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820759
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820759,
					"content": "#哎呀！{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}看珀西芙都不太會說話，鐵定找不到其他人幫忙了，我們就幫幫她吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820760
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820760,
					"content": "那要怎麼幫忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820762
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820762,
					"content": "鑰匙，鑰匙，鑰匙，數量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820763
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820763,
					"content": "然後呢？鑰匙的數量是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820764
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820764,
					"content": "鑰匙！鑰匙！鑰匙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820765
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820765,
					"content": "三把鑰匙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820766
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820766,
					"content": "珀西芙！鑰匙，霧道，南…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820767
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820767,
					"content": "鑰匙，泉眼，北…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820768
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820768,
					"content": "鑰匙，垂柳，東…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820769
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820769,
					"content": "哦！原來是這個意思…那我先記一下…一共有三把鑰匙，分別是南邊的霧道、北邊的泉眼、東邊的垂柳…是這樣吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820770
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820770,
					"content": "鑰匙，鑰匙，鑰匙，廣場，西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820771
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820771,
					"content": "西邊的廣場還有三把鑰匙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820772
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820772,
					"content": "集齊三把鑰匙去廣場？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820773
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820773,
					"content": "#派蒙，美露莘！{NICKNAME}，珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820774
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820774,
					"content": "#哎呀！珀西芙，妳不要老是說這種顯得{NICKNAME}比我聰明的話嘛！明明我和{M#他}{F#她}差不多聰明才對！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820775
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820775,
					"content": "總而言之，現在我們已經得到一把鑰匙了，看來只要再弄到另外兩把就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820776
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820776,
					"content": "伊黎耶，美露莘…珀西芙，保護！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820777
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820777,
					"content": "妳放心啦！雖然不知道發生了什麼，但我們會幫妳保護伊黎耶島的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820778
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820778,
					"content": "不過我再補充一小點哦！珀西芙，假如妳碰巧看見一種沒有人要的，亮晶晶的，圓滾滾的東西，或者一看就很貴的箱子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820779
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820779,
					"content": "能跟我們說一聲就再好不過啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820780
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820780,
					"content": "珀西芙似懂非懂地摸了摸頭，又高興地蹦跳了兩下，然後略顯匆忙地離開了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820781
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820781,
					"content": "#啊！她就直接跑掉了，看來是很緊急的事。{NICKNAME}，我們現在就去尋找另外兩把鑰匙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820761,
					"content": "那要怎麼幫忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820762
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820710,
					"content": "說不定是別人存放在這裡的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820711,
					"content": "什麼？完蛋了，那我們不就成了小偷了？對不起對不起…我們快把東西放回去吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820712,
					"content": "啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820713,
					"content": "完蛋了！主人回來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820714,
					"content": "主人？美露莘。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				}
			]
		},
