				{
					"id": 740821004,
					"content": "無影蹤，珀西芙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821005,
					"content": "好吧…妳真是我見過的最特別的美露莘…對了，我印象中的美露莘，大多都生活在楓丹廷或者海沫村…妳怎麼會在這裡呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821006,
					"content": "楓丹廷？海沫村？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821007,
					"content": "看妳好像很疑惑的樣子，妳沒聽過這兩個名字嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821008,
					"content": "楓丹廷、美露莘…海沫村、美露莘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821009,
					"content": "啊…伊黎耶、珀西芙、家鄉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821010,
					"content": "伊黎耶、珀西芙，守護！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821011,
					"content": "等等！妳說這裡是妳的家鄉？妳在守護妳的家鄉？",
