					"nextDialogs": [
						740821012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821012,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821013,
					"content": "可是美露莘的家鄉是海沫村吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740821014,
					"content": "是啊！好奇怪，還有出生在別的地方的美露莘嗎？可是這裡看起來也沒有其他美露莘了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821015,
					"content": "珀西芙，妳都是一個人生活在這裡的嗎？",
